/-! ### §3.5 Case QJQ: $\frac14\le x\le\frac12\le y$, $x+y\le1$ -/

/-- [DIRX], §3.5 (Case $QJQ$): $G[B_{w_1}](x,y)\ge0$ for $\frac14\le x\le\frac12\le y$,
$x+y\le1$. -/
theorem caseQJQ (x y : ℝ) (hx : x ∈ Icc (1 / 4 : ℝ) (1 / 2)) (hy : 1 / 2 ≤ y)
    (hxy : x + y ≤ 1) : G (B_{w₁}) x y ≥ 0 := by
